# booker-flowers-storefront

Storefront, admin dashboard and delivery-driver portal for Booker Flowers & Gifts, an award-winning independent florist in Allerton, Liverpool that delivers with its own vans. Three sides in one TanStack Start app on Cloudflare Workers:

- **Storefront** (`/`, `/flowers`, `/product/$slug`, `/cart`): browse, choose delivery date and slot, pay with Stripe.
- **Admin** (`/admin/*`, role `admin`): orders, CSV order import (test data until the daily fetch exists), products, staff.
- **Driver portal** (`/driver/*`, role `driver` or `admin`): load the van, plan the shortest route, drag to reorder and split into sections, per-stop delivered/failed with note and photo. Status changes email the customer.

Elegant florist look with a ladybird mark: cream, botanical green, blush and rose, brass hairlines, red-spotted awning accent. Lowest practical running cost.

## Layout and import law

- App root: `src/routes/` (thin TanStack file routes), `src/features/`, `src/components/`, `src/data/`, `src/domain/`, `src/services/`, `src/stores/`, `src/utilities/`. Alias `~/` → `src/`.
- No shared packages, no `packages/*` (single standalone app).
- Orders, catalogue, staff, routes: Cloudflare D1 (`migrations/`). Delivery photos: R2 bucket `PHOTOS`.

```
route → feature, data, domain, services
data → domain, services
domain → utilities (NOT data, NOT services)
services → domain types, utilities
```

Server code runs only inside `createServerFn` handlers or server routes (`server.handlers`). Every server function and API route starts with `requireStaff(...)` unless it is public storefront data. Route `beforeLoad` guards (`guardRoute`) are UX; `requireStaff` is the security boundary.

Canonical nouns: order, product, variant, basket (UI) / cart (code), route, stop, section, driver. Glossary: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## On-demand rules (read before touching matching paths)

| File | Scope |
|---|---|
| `external-integrations.mdc` | Any Stripe / Resend / Google call |
| `database.mdc` | `src/data/**`, `migrations/**` |
| `theme.mdc` | styles, tokens, motion |
| `copy.mdc` | UI text |
| `accessibility.mdc` | components, routes |
| `interaction.mdc` | components, routes |
| `testing.mdc` | tests |

## Gates before merge

- `pnpm check` green on every push (pre-push hook + CI)
- `pnpm predeploy` green before merge
- Commits and PRs: plain messages; no attribution trailers unless the owner asks
